 Expected behavior\r\n<!-- Describe what the desired behavior would be. -->\r\nWould expect this to always be a string, as paramMap.get() claims\r\n\r\n## Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions\r\nhttps://angular-gitter-gd3f8s.stackblitz.io/notTheRoot;numVal=9;strVal=14\r\nhttps://stackblitz.com/edit/angular-gitter-gd3f8s\r\n\r\nThe values change every 3 seconds. On page load, numVal will be a string, but then after updating will be a number. strVal is the same, except toString is called.\r\n\r\n## What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?\r\n<!-- Describe the motivation or the concrete use case. -->\r\nActual types matching types declared by api\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\nSee StackBlitz\r\n<pre><code>\r\nAngular version: X.Y.Z\r\n<!-- Check whether this is still an issue in the most recent Angular version -->\r\n\r\nBrowser:\r\n- [x ] Chrome (desktop) version 65\r\n- [ ] Chrome (Android) version XX\r\n- [ ] Chrome (iOS) version XX\r\n- [ ] Firefox version XX\r\n- [ ] Safari (desktop) version XX\r\n- [ ] Safari (iOS) version XX\r\n- [ ] IE version XX\r\n- [ ] Edge version XX\r\n \r\nFor Tooling issues:\r\n- Node version: XX  <!-- run `node --version` -->\r\n- Platform:  <!-- Mac, Linux, Windows -->\r\n\r\nOthers:\r\n<!-- Anything else relevant?  Operating system version, IDE, package manager, HTTP server, ... -->\r\n</code></pre>\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"jessicajaniuk","id":72768744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzY4NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72768744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk","html_url":"https://github.com/jessicajaniuk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi